About the Role
As a Junior Creator, you will report directly to the Lead Producer. In this role, you will work closely with them to execute our daily creative vision, align on format execution, and ensure all fast-turnaround and scheduled output meets our production standards.
What you’ll be doing:
• Content Execution & Production Support: Film and produce engaging short and long-form video content across our studio and remote setups, supporting both studio and on-location production behind the camera. Handle a mix of formats, from capturing mobile-shot social to assisting on high-end multi-cam long form productions.
• On-Camera Presence: Show a readiness and enthusiasm to appear on camera across company-owned social media channels, including GOAL, Front Three, Fanzone, etc. You will bring your unique personality and passion for football directly to Footballco audiences.
